[LINK: (December 30) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/December_30]  – Congolese troops capture  [LINK: (Albert Kalonji) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Albert_Kalonji]  of  [LINK: (South Kasai) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_Kasai]  (who soon escapes).

[LINK: (December 31) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/December_31]  – Ireland's first national television station, Telefís Éireann (later  [LINK: (Raidió Teilifís Éireann) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raidi%C3%B3_Teilif%C3%ADs_%C3%89ireann] ), begins broadcasting.


